  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.m0rf30.Aulos.desktop</launchable>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>
      Aulos is a music player built on a UI-independent Rust backend. The
      current egui front end is an early prototype: it browses and plays a
      local library, with MPD and Subsonic/OpenSubsonic providers, embedded
      cover art and lyrics handled by the backend.
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>Aulos: it really pipes the satyr's ass.</em>
    </p>
  </description>
